WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:08.520
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:15.030
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.860
It's my day!

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:27.440
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.850
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:42.220
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:49.630
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:55.400
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:02.540
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:10.050
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:16.190
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.260
I just want to walk

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.790
Not on tip-toe

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:26.760
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:35.670
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:42.110
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:44.380
It's my day!

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:04.830
"No Brand Girl!"

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.480
<i>Okay... I'm giving it
my all today.</i>

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.590
<i>But, to be honest,
I'm feeling a little blue...</i>

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:31.630
<i>Tsukushi, you've got to
get into Eitoku Academy.</i>

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.130
<i>The children of the
other families here</i>

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.630
<i>are all going to
first-rate high schools.</i>

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:40.830
<i>I was stupid for not
sticking to my guns.</i>

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.610
Oh, it's the F4!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.270
They're coming to school
together.

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:55.010
<i>Humph! They must all have
a few loose screws!</i>

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:13.800
<i>Oh, no! Why am I blushing?</i>

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.140
- Is she coming?
- Yes.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.580
Ready and...

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:27.780
Makino... Good morning!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.280
G-good morning...

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.080
I talked to her!

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.690
G-good morning.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.620
G-good m-morning...

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.660
Good morning, Makino.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.730
<i>What? What's going on?</i>

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:03.810
Did you do it too?

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:07.920
Greet Tsukushi Makino
without the F4 finding out...

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.720
How exciting!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.060
<i>How dare they use me as a game!</i>

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.600
That Tsukushi Makino is
really something, though!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.900
No one else could
stand up to the F4.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.670
Isn't she cool?

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:28.040
<i>Well, I guess it's okay...</i>

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:36.190
Um...

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.550
Shh...

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.740
<i>Tsukushi...</i>

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.240
<i>Don't worry about me.</i>

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.730
He's not here, either...

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.730
<i>I wonder if he's here today.</i>

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.200
I wanted to thank him again...

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.640
when he is alone, without
the other F4 members.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:17.660
Oh!

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.360
What are you doing here?

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.530
W-well, I-I wanted to
thank you for yesterday.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.800
If you hadn't come, I don't
know what might have happened.

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:22.710
I really...

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:24.980
I really want to thank you.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.810
I shouldn't have helped you...

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.930
If you were going to be
such a pest.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.050
But, I was really happy.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.790
For the first time since
I came to this school,

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.260
I was so happy that I cried.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:42.960
Maybe I'll come to see you
in the emergency stairway.

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:47.330
Then, I won't go there again.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:56.840
<i>How strange...</i>

00:07:57.170 --> 00:08:00.480
<i>He said such awful things,
but I don't feel angry.</i>

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:05.550
<i>That melody... the honesty
in his music</i>

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.580
<i>expressed a side of him
that belied his words.</i>

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:14.190
<i>The center of my brain
feels a little numb.</i>

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.730
<i>Tsukushi... Good luck.</i>

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.460
Makiko...

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.370
Tsukushi Makino...

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.230
Please come with us.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:13.480
We won't do anything rough, as long
as you come peaceably.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:16.550
Wait! What are you doing?

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:19.870
<i>Tsukasa Domyoji!</i>

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.890
You're going to pay for what you did.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.230
Ow... She bit me.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.700
You'd better behave!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:42.470
<i>No... He's completely crazy.
I've got to escape!</i>

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.010
Let go of me!

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:45.940
Let me out!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:52.280
It's no use, Miss.
It's locked from the outside.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.060
<i>Somebody! Dad! Mom!</i>

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.790
<i>I did my best...</i>

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:07.930
<i>It was a mistake to enter 
Eitoku, just like I thought...</i>

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:12.160
<i>But I don't regret doing what I did...</i>

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.440
The body's not bad.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:58.480
Shall we tone things up
a little using low frequency?

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:09.760
All right.
Let's take these off...

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.040
What plain underwear.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:30.840
<i>W-what's going on?!</i>

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:35.420
No!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.320
Hey!

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.990
That tickles! Stop it!

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:53.900
Thank you for your patience...

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:00.700
<i>This person...</i>

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:03.840
<i>It's the hairstylist
I saw in that magazine...</i>

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.480
<i>I don't understand
what's going on.</i>

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:12.090
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.220
Put this on when you're done.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:28.460
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.550
<i>Is this really me?</i>

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.480
<i>I can't believe it!</i>

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.820
Please wait here.

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.970
<i>Huh? Could that be...</i>

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.470
Rui Hanazawa?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.810
That's us, the F4,
in first grade.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:12.240
<i>I completely forgot!</i>

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.480
Are you in love with Rui?

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:17.880
<i>I forgot that he was here!</i>

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.990
Hate to say it,
but Rui's not available.

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:24.690
Why do you care!
Just tell me where I am.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:28.160
Humph... It's my home.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.400
Home? This is your home?

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:41.570
<i>What?! Why, this room alone is
bigger than our house!</i>

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:44.400
<i>And they have an in-house
beauty salon!</i>

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.510
How did you like the
first-class beauty treatment?

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:51.280
It cost more than
you'd earn in a lifetime.

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.780
420,000 yen, all together.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:00.020
F-four hundred twenty thousand?!

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.730
Look at this portrait.

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.260
What a beautiful woman!

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.470
She's my sister. She's married.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.770
You two are about
as different as light and day.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.710
Don't you mean <i>night</i> and day?

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.950
Anyway, this just proves that
even an average girl like you...

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:29.350
will shine if polished.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.420
Listen... What are you
trying to say?

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:36.460
Why did you do this to me?
What are you thinking?

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:39.230
You're such an airhead.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.260
I'm saying I'll make
a big concession to you

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:45.000
and allow you to hang
out with me.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:48.570
Of course, you'll never
be a replacement for my sister.

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:49.940
Huh?

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:55.110
Of course, I'll still ignore you 
at school, as always.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:58.550
But when no one's around,
you can talk to me.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.950
<i>What is he talking about?</i>

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.220
Well? Aren't you happy?

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:08.320
Did that kick to the head
scramble your brains?

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:10.690
Did you really expect me
to be happy?

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.130
What's your problem?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:17.630
You can enjoy all the luxury
you want while you're here.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.270
I'm heir to the Domyoji Group!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:26.810
There is nothing in this world
that can't be bought.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.210
I could even buy me
a department store.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:32.910
Ouch!

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:38.720
I'm changing my clothes.
Give me back my uniform.

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:41.220
I'll pay you back
for the haircut.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:42.790
Don't be stubborn.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:45.290
What do you think I am?

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.360
You think you can buy me
like merchandise?

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:52.800
I'm sorry to disappoint you,
but I can't be bought.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:54.900
I'm going home.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:57.570
W-what are you saying?
You pauper!

00:15:58.300 --> 00:15:59.770
Who do you think you are?

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.210
I'm name-brand from head to toe.
What about you?

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:14.120
I'm no-brand. Don't put me together
with all the other girls out there.

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:19.160
S-sis...

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.530
No...

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:40.480
<i>Maybe there really isn't anything
money can't buy...</i>

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.610
What are you doing?

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.180
<i>Rui Hanazawa!</i>

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.890
What are you doing here?

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.620
I'm on my way home.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.660
<i>Hate to say it,
but Rui's not available.</i>

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:58.160
Bye...

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:00.230
Wait!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:01.700
What?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.530
Um...

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:08.040
Do you think there's anything
money can't buy?

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.570
Air...

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:16.180
Weird girl...

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.220
<i>Oh... I've found it.</i>

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.320
<i>Something that can't be bought.</i>

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.000
Oh! How awful!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.070
Man... I can't believe it.

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:42.270
What nerve!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:48.910
Tsukushi Makino ran with 
delinquents in junior high! She slept
around and has a bastard child!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:50.680
What?!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.390
How could I have a bastard child?!
Idiot!

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:05.760
I'm still a virgin!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.200
What was that about?

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:17.170
She came here to tell me
she's a virgin.

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:20.040
In other words, that
she doesn't belong to anyone.

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:23.310
I think she likes me!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:28.220
<i>That is not funny!
It's so nasty!</i>

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:35.430
What an awful thing to do!

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:40.430
Asai... Ayuhara... Yamano...

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:46.030
The F4 is unforgivable!

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:49.840
I don't know what I would do
if someone wrote that about me.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.270
You're really so strong, Tsukushi.

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.040
Strong...

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:55.880
<i>This is unexpected...</i>

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.550
<i>I've never even spoken
to these girls before...</i>

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:00.010
Listen...

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:02.380
So we can get
to know you better,

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:08.490
why don't I invite you
to the Lionel Group party.

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:10.260
Lionel Group?

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.860
Don't worry, it's just
a casual jeans party.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.800
Tickets are 20,000 yen, but...

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.500
20,000 yen?!

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.400
Of course, the ticket's on us.

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:23.500
It's set. 6pm at Roppongi.

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:29.340
<i>These girls might not be
so bad, after all...</i>

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:33.880
So, are you going to that
dance party tonight?

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.310
I can't keep up with them,
materially,

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:39.880
but deep inside, I am hoping
that this will grow into a friendship.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:42.020
Hey, Tsukushi!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.760
Those really cool guys
are peeking in.

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:49.930
<i>Yikes! It's Nishikado
and Rui Hanazawa!</i>

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:55.030
It really is you, Tsukushi Makino.
What are you doing here?

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:57.570
Well, I work here.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.700
Work? You're a working girl?

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:03.910
Or, in your case,
a working virgin, right?

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.180
Don't say such things!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.580
Don't tell me they're
members of the F4.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.550
I'm Yuki Matsuoka, her friend
from junior high.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.920
Thank you for taking care
of Tsukushi.

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:21.260
Hey! Stop with the 
nonsense greeting!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.900
Give me this cake...
the pink one.

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:30.070
We're going out on the town.
What are you gonna do with that?

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:33.440
Besides, I thought
you didn't like sweets...

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:36.640
Yeah. I can't eat it,
but it's cute...

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.010
This guy is really weird.

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:42.120
He once got attached to those
stones on the side of the road...

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:44.750
Nishikado! Will you shut up?!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:45.980
How much?

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.820
237 yen.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:50.520
See ya!

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.900
- Your change!
- Keep it.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:10.950
A jeans party?
In such a fancy place?

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:22.380
<i>No way! Everyone's dressed up!</i>

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:26.050
Oh, it's Makino! You're late.

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:29.430
Why do you have that look
on your face?

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.860
Uh... the jeans party...

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:35.800
Oh, come on... It was a joke!

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:38.270
Who would have a jeans party

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:40.880
at an elite club in the middle
of Roppongi?

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:50.880
<i>They tricked me!</i>

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:11.700
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:19.570
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:29.450
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:37.490
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:45.260
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:53.400
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:53.400
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.400 --> 00:23:01.780
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.400 --> 00:23:01.780
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:11.560
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:19.330
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:27.500
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:27.500
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:35.910
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:35.910
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.230
<i>Rui Hanazawa...</i>

00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:55.260
<i>I couldn't possibly
fall in love with him.</i>

00:23:56.870 --> 00:24:00.300
<i>Still... Why do I feel so blue?</i>

00:24:00.570 --> 00:24:03.940
<i>It's not like me.
I've got to do something.</i>

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.310
<i>Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"I Won't Be Hurt!"</i>
